  `stdcx.`, `stdx`, `stdux`, `extsw`, `sld`, ...), eleven more are absent on every width; the licensed fix is the `rld*`
  idiom (PEM :6253 + the opcode-30 precedent) applied to the ungated implemented set in its own round).
